── SYNTAX ERROR ────────────────────────────── E0100_java_public.lt:1:1  [E0100]

Stilt marks an item public with `pub`, not `public`:

  1 │ public fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 { a + b }
    │ ^^^^^^

An item is private to its module unless it is `pub`.

To fix it, write `pub`:

  1 │ pub fn add(a: i64, b: i64) -> i64 { a + b }
    │ ~~~
